      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A Cosine Gradient turns a number from 0 to 1 into a color, along a palette made of three cosine waves. Here the number is the Linear Gradient's brightness, black at the left and white at the right, so the whole palette is laid out across the screen; the Master Gear in its Time cycles it. Drag the Phase and Freq rows in the grid on the node and watch the strip."
        }
      },
